{"ref":"BDB, נָכֵא","hw":"נָכֵא","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נָכֵא</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. id.</strong>, always f. <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ נְכֵאָה</span> <em>a stricken spirit</em>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.13\">Pr 15:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.22\">17:22</a> (both opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב שָׂמֵחַ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.14\">18:14</a>.","next":"BDB, נְכֹאת","prev":"BDB, נָכָא²"}